  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling durable solutions to internal displacement in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Programme (JP) supports the Government of Mozambique in advancing implementation of the Action Plan for the Management of Internal Displacement (PEGDIAP), aiming to place prioritized internally displaced persons (IDPs) on pathways to durable solutions through a comprehensive and government-owned approach. The JP combines institutional strengthening, development of standardized tools, community engagement and policy advice, data systems strengthening and implementation of location-level</narrative>
  </description>
